  "metaDescription": "Perum Bulog Bandung introduced the Bulingga program to improve food access while the agency received a national award for food security contributions.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Perum Bulog's Bandung branch launched the Bulingga mobile service to improve local access to food supplies.",
    "The organization received national recognition for its ongoing efforts to maintain and strengthen national food security.",
